            "review_title": "Review at Marugame Udon - Aeon Mall Thanh Khê Đà Nẵng",
            "review_text": "misskroft\nMoscow, Russia759 contributions\n0\nOur favorite place. Special trip here for noodles\nJul 2026 • Couples\nWe love this place very much and come to the mall regularly just to eat noodles here. It's always delicious, clean, and the price tag pleases the eye.\nThe soups are just great--and big, and the small portions are very satisfying. A huge plus is that sauces, fresh greens, onions and ice can be dialled for free on your own at the counter and tailor the taste to suit you. From the drinks separately I want to highlight the option with lychee -tasty and refreshing.\nToday we decided to try something new and took rice with meat and kimchi. The rice was absolutely delicious. \nDefinitely recommend this place to all lovers of Japanese cuisine. We'll keep coming over and over.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten July 28, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
